# Storefront UI and i18n

## Pages and structure

- Pages live under `src/app/[locale]/` with co-located `actions.ts`, `loading.tsx`, and feature components.
- Commerce UI → `src/components/commerce/`; layout → `src/components/layout/`.

## Internationalization (mandatory)

- All user-facing strings use `next-intl` — add keys to both `messages/en.json` and `messages/de.json`.
- Use `@/i18n/navigation` for locale-aware links, not raw `next/link`.
- Respect `routing.locales` and `getRouteLocale()` / `setRequestLocale()` conventions.

## UI components

- Reuse shadcn/ui from `src/components/ui/` before adding primitives.
- Match Tailwind + `cn()` / CVA patterns; support dark mode via `ThemeProvider`.
- Add `loading.tsx` skeletons where the rest of the app does.
